<title>AZERBAIJAN: SOCCER-KAPAZ GANCA BEAT HAZRI BUSOVNA IN AZERI CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KAPAZ GANCA BEAT HAZRI BUSOVNA IN AZERI CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>BAKU 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kapaz Ganca beat Hazri Busovna 1-0 (halftime 1-0) in the final of the Azeri Cup on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Scorer: Mamed Mardanov 44</p>
</text>
